  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except for sodium formate, vitamin solution, cysteine-HCl and Na2S·9H2O, and autoclave under N2/CO2 (80/20) condition. Separately autoclave cysteine-HCl and Na2S·9H2O as a 6% solution under a N2 atmosphere. Aseptically and anaerobically add filter-sterile vitamin and neutralized 1.6 M formate solutions, and cysteine-HCl and Na2S·9H2O solutions."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "First dissolve nitrilotriacetic acid and adjust pH to 6.5 with NaOH, and then add minerals. Final pH 7.0."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}